🔐 Cybersecurity Portfolio

Overview

This section documents my hands-on cybersecurity learning journey,
practical security exercises, cybersecurity job simulations,
security-focused projects, certifications, and technical development.

My cybersecurity work focuses on developing practical knowledge in
security fundamentals, threat detection, vulnerability awareness,
security monitoring, access control, incident response, network
security, and defensive security operations.

My networking and IT support experience also provides a strong technical
foundation for understanding how systems, networks, users, and security
controls interact.

🎯 Cybersecurity Objectives

Through my cybersecurity studies, labs, simulations, and projects, I have
